# Anything that could carry a study participant's details. People who rate material are
# participants: a report names them R1, R2 and so on, and the rater-agreement commands
# refuse a label file whose name is not a pseudonym. These rules are by name rather than
# by location, so a file moved out of the data directory does not become committable.
*_labels.jsonl
*_labels_*.jsonl
human_labels_*.jsonl
rater_pseudonyms.json
annotators_data/
blv_responses_*.jsonl
*answers_*.htm
*answers_*.html
